# Build an Agentic Pitch Generator: Orchestration, Evaluation, and Analytics with Google Cloud

## Welcome to the Agent Masterclass

![agent masterclass banner](img/banner.png)

## Overview

Learn how to build a multimodal multi-agent engine that takes a raw topic brief and orchestrates the creation of highly engaging social assets. Using Google's Agent Development Kit (ADK) and the Agent2Agent (A2A) protocol, you'll compose autonomous micro-agents, package brand rules as a reusable agent skill, deploy the services to Cloud Run, and score the generated key visuals for brand compliance with BigQuery AI functions.

## Deploy

This is a companion repository for an amazing Google Skills lab. Point your agent at the deployment instructions and profit!